Subject: [PATCH] cmake: link the WSPR simulator against libm

The simulator calls functions such as sin(), log() and pow().  Link libm
explicitly on Unix, as in the WSJT-X recipe.

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1119 +1119,4 @@
-add_executable (wsprsim ${wsprsim_CSRCS})
+add_executable (wsprsim ${wsprsim_CSRCS})
+if (UNIX)
+  target_link_libraries (wsprsim m)
+endif ()
